# Queues and cron

## Queues (BullMQ)

- Defined under app/server/queues/
  - backupQueue.ts — backups
  - plaidSyncQueue.ts — Plaid transaction sync
  - plaidSyncBalanceQueue.ts — Plaid balance-only sync
  - recalculateQueue.ts — forecast recalculation
- queuesClient.ts wires BullMQ with Redis
- queueManager.ts and queueManagerPlugin.ts support orchestration and graceful lifecycle

## Cron tasks (nuxt-cron)

Located in app/server/cron/:
- backup.daily.ts
- bill-reminders.hourly.ts
- plaid.daily.ts, plaid-balance.hourly.ts
- recalculate.hourly.ts
- crypto-balance.hourly.ts

Cron tasks typically delegate to services (e.g., PlaidSyncService, notification services) or enqueue work onto queues. Ensure idempotency and guardrails (rateLimiter, env flags in tests) for scheduled runs.
